library.meam: Baskes, Phys. Rev. B 46, 2727 (1992), and the further
parameter sets listed in the file.
Ni.meam: parameter file of the LAMMPS examples/meam directory.
SiC.meam: parameter file for the Si-C pair of the same directory.
library_2nn.meam, MoCoNiVFeAlCr_2nn.meam: Wang, Kwon, Kim et al., npj
Comput. Mater. 9, 60 (2023), second-neighbour MEAM for Mo, Co, Ni, V, Fe,
Al and Cr.
